    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced party game full of chaos, explosions, and unpredictable moments. Battle your friends on destructible maps packed with fun and surprises \u2014 all wrapped in a wild pixel art style with glowing neon vibes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art glowing with bright neon tones for a striking, energetic feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer lets you play with friends anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible maps let you blow up and reshape the battlefield as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of weapons and arenas keeps gameplay fresh and exciting</p></li></ul>",
